36:["$","p","0",{"children":"Yes. IGCH in Kadavanthra offers dialysis in Kochi. Our dialysis unit has completed over 15,000 hemodialysis sessions. The hospital’s 24-hour emergency care and ICU are on the same campus."}]
37:["$","p","1",{"children":"We offer cashless treatment through major TPAs and insurance companies. IGCH is also a CGHS-empanelled, NABH-accredited hospital in Kochi. For planned treatment, CGHS patients should bring a referral from their wellness centre. In an emergency, come directly. Please carry your insurance card, photo ID and past reports. As a co-operative hospital, we try to keep care within reach. If cost is a worry, please talk to our team before treatment starts."}]
